  "details": "A screenspace version of the Debug Menu that simulates the behavior of the previous GUI versions.\n\nThe reason for needing this is when the player is being moved around during testing (related: https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1761-debug-menu-tracking-space-option), the world space UI of the Debug Menu is obstructed by other VRChat UI elements, and *primarily* when the view is overdrawn by another camera. An overdrawing camera to the main view can make the normal VRChat UI inaccessible but a screenspace element would remain overtop.",
